# invokeai.schema — who may set each key of the `invokeai` subsystem (see w-conf.md).
# Format: <KEY>\t<scope>   scope: system | user | both
#
# Every key is `system`, for the same reason as comfyui.schema: InvokeAI runs on
# W as ONE machine-wide service under its own account, and where it is installed,
# which address it answers on and which PyTorch build sits in its virtualenv are
# root-domain facts a user layer could not act on (the unit is rendered by a root
# setup step).
ROOT	system
LISTEN	system
PORT	system
GPU	system
